      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "WAN throughput comes from gateway interface counters. Top-client traffic can include LAN transfers and must not be summed as Internet usage. Reporting devices/clients reflect the controller response; a missing device needs investigation in UniFi. Polling is once per minute."
      }
    }
  ]
}
